OL,3,GNEWSAUNESCO assessors visit
OL,4,ACross-Channel Geopark
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssessors have visited the Kent Downs
OL,7,FNational Landscape as a bid to secure
OL,8,FUNESCO status gathers pace.
OL,10,FThe visit is part of efforts to attain
OL,11,Fstatus for the aspiring Cross-Channel
OL,12,FGeopark, which spans the Kent Downs,
OL,13,Fthe English Channel and northern
OL,14,FFrance.
OL,16,FIf successful, it would join UNESCO's
OL,17,Fglobal network of geoparks, which are
OL,18,Frecognised for their internationally
OL,19,Fsignificant geology.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
