OL,3,GNEWSAUNESCO assessors visit
OL,4,ACross-Channel Geopark
OL,5,
OL,6,FJamie Henderson, Kent County Council
OL,7,F(KCC) cabinet member for environment,
OL,8,Fcoastal regeneration and public health,
OL,9,Fsaid the area showcases "some of the
OL,10,Fmost remarkable natural heritage found
OL,11,Fanywhere in Europe".
